  "name": "Harness² (Google Research)",
  "summary": "Open-source framework for recursive agent harnessing: the agent proposes edits to its own harness (prompt, tools, memory, skills, subagents), probes candidate versions on the same task and composes a better one from the behavioural differences, without a grader or ground truth. Lessons carry over to the next task; model weights stay fixed.",
